exchange:
  USD_EUR: 0.92
  EUR_GBP: 0.86
  GBP_JPY: 191.50
globals:
  budget: 5000 EUR
---

# Currency Conversion

Exchange rates are defined in frontmatter and used with the `in` keyword.

## Basic conversion

price = 100 USD
price_in_euros = price in EUR

## Dollar symbol conversion

total = $200 in EUR

## Variable with conversion

budget_gbp = budget in GBP

## Multiple rates in one document

yen_price = 1000 GBP in JPY

## Inline exchange rate assignment

@exchange.USD_GBP = 0.79
salary = 3000 USD
salary_gbp = salary in GBP

## Same currency no-op

unchanged = 100 USD in USD
